hw 1: powering on
  [OK] connected, key ON, interlocks closed
  ceilings clamped to 250 mA
  TEC OFF (open-loop; room temp-controlled)
  LASER ON at floor setpoint 5 (~0.2 mW). Use `set <dBm>` to ramp.
  ramp setpoint 5.0 -> 19.4  (0.2s @ 60/s)
  +8.0 dBm -> setpoint 19.4  (~6.3 mW; measured I 17 mA)
